flowchart LR
    USER[External entity: User] -->|Request text| SYS[P18 Intelligent Agentic AI Router]
    SYS -->|Decision, result, or review state| USER
    REVIEWER[External entity: Human reviewer] -->|Approve reject clarify and feedback| SYS
    SYS -->|Review outcome| REVIEWER
    SYS -->|Classification request only in Gemini mode| GEM[External entity: Gemini API]
    GEM -->|Structured classification response| SYS
    SYS -->|Operational requests and actual agent traces| OPDB[(Operational SQLite store)]
    OPDB -->|History and trace data| SYS
    EVAL[External entity: Evaluation operator] -->|Run benchmark command| SYS
    SYS -->|Metrics and case results| EDB[(Evaluation-only SQLite store)]
    EDB -->|Stored evaluation summaries| SYS
    SYS -->|JSON and CSV snapshots| OPERATOR[Evaluation operator]
